#chip 16F1829, 8

'Repeat For test (Change 1654): Loop body: If with no Else (only the test is counted), on 16F1829
'Expect: compiles, and the whole Repeat For construct runs exactly 40,000 clock cycles
'(checked by simulating the generated assembly instruction by instruction)

#option explicit
Dim Flag As Bit
Dim Cnt As Byte
Dim X As Byte
Dim Y As Byte
Dim W1 As Word
Dim W2 As Word
Repeat For 20 ms
    If Flag = 1 Then
        Flag = 0
    End If
    Wait 10 us
End Repeat
Do
Loop
